  "text": "AFK Arch-Glacor\n\n​\nDisclaimer\n⬥ IF YOU CANNOT GET A METHOD TO WORK DO NOT MESSAGE THE CREATOR(S)\n‎ ‎ ‎ ‎• It is more than likely user error or cutting corners, use #pvm-help if you cannot get it to work\n​\nMelee AFK Method (85 kph) \nOverview\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nUseful Items and Unlocks\n\n⬥ The following ARE REQUIRED for this method to work:\n    • Cutting corners will result in failure\n    • A more extensive list can be found in #unknown-channel\n\nEquipment\n⬥ Masterwork 2H Sword \n    •    \n⬥ Gloves of Passage \n⬥ Vestments of havoc armour \n    • Full Set   \n⬥ Igneous Kal-Ket  or Igneous Kal-Zuk \n    • Expect less kph if not using\nAbilities\n⬥ Chaos Roar \n    • Expect less kph if not using\n⬥ Greater Fury \n    • May replace with  if unowned\nOther\n⬥ 0 Mech (85 kph)\n    • Assumes no mechanics are enabled\n    • Allows for the highest kph\n    • No prayers required\n⬥ 2 Mech (60 kph)\n    • Assumes Flurry and Frost Cannon mechanics are enabled\n    • Better for charms and \n    • Pray  and  or \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n​\nPresets and Relics\n⬥ Melee (0 Mech) \n⬥ Melee (2 Mech) \n\n​\nAction Bars\n⬥ 0 Mech\n\n⬥ 2 Mech\n\n​\nExample Kills\n⬥ Melee (0 Mech) \n⬥ Melee (2 Mech) \n​\nNecromancy AFK Method (~80 kph) \nOverview\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nUseful Items and Unlocks\n\n⬥ The following ARE REQUIRED for this method to work:\n    • Cutting corners will result in failure\n    • A more extensive list can be found in #unknown-channel\n\nEquipment\n⬥ Occultist's ring \n    • Passive effect will increase kph\n⬥ Igneous Kal-Mor  or Igneous Kal-Zuk \n    • Expect less kph if not using\nAbilities\n⬥ Conjure Undead Army \n    • Ensure    are selected\n    •  not required\nOther\n⬥ Equilibrium  or Mahjarrat \n    • Not required but increase kph\n⬥ This method does not require Soul Split \n    • You may opt to not use a damage prayer to increase AFK time\n    • Expect less kph if not using\n⬥ This guide assumes no mechanics are enabled\n    • This allows for the highest kph\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n​\nPresets and Relics\n⬥ Necromancy (T90) \n⬥ Necromancy (T95-T100) \n\n​\nAction Bars\n\n⬥ If  is unowned, place  in its slot\n​\nExample Kills\n⬥ Necromancy \n​\n      \n    ",
  "normalizedText": "AFK Arch-Glacor ​ Disclaimer ⬥ IF YOU CANNOT GET A METHOD TO WORK DO NOT MESSAGE THE CREATOR(S) ‎ ‎ ‎ ‎• It is more than likely user error or cutting corners, use #pvm-help if you cannot get it to work ​ Melee AFK Method (85 kph) Overview Useful Items and Unlocks ⬥ The following ARE REQUIRED for this method to work: • Cutting corners will result in failure • A more extensive list can be found in #unknown-channel Equipment ⬥ Masterwork 2H Sword • ⬥ Gloves of Passage ⬥ Vestments of havoc armour • Full Set ⬥ Igneous Kal-Ket or Igneous Kal-Zuk • Expect less kph if not using Abilities ⬥ Chaos Roar • Expect less kph if not using ⬥ Greater Fury • May replace with if unowned Other ⬥ 0 Mech (85 kph) • Assumes no mechanics are enabled • Allows for the highest kph • No prayers required ⬥ 2 Mech (60 kph) • Assumes Flurry and Frost Cannon mechanics are enabled • Better for charms and • Pray and or ​ Presets and Relics ⬥ Melee (0 Mech) ⬥ Melee (2 Mech) ​ Action Bars ⬥ 0 Mech ⬥ 2 Mech ​ Example Kills ⬥ Melee (0 Mech) ⬥ Melee (2 Mech) ​ Necromancy AFK Method (~80 kph) Overview Useful Items and Unlocks ⬥ The following ARE REQUIRED for this method to work: • Cutting corners will result in failure • A more extensive list can be found in #unknown-channel Equipment ⬥ Occultist's ring • Passive effect will increase kph ⬥ Igneous Kal-Mor or Igneous Kal-Zuk • Expect less kph if not using Abilities ⬥ Conjure Undead Army • Ensure are selected • not required Other ⬥ Equilibrium or Mahjarrat • Not required but increase kph ⬥ This method does not require Soul Split • You may opt to not use a damage prayer to increase AFK time • Expect less kph if not using ⬥ This guide assumes no mechanics are enabled • This allows for the highest kph ​ Presets and Relics ⬥ Necromancy (T90) ⬥ Necromancy (T95-T100) ​ Action Bars ⬥ If is unowned, place in its slot ​ Example Kills ⬥ Necromancy ​",
